<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <title>{{ isAttestation ? 'Attestation de paiement' : 'Facture adhésion' }} {{ user.fullName }} — {{ seasonLabel }}</title>
    <style>
        @page { margin: 18mm 20mm 32mm 20mm; }
        body { font-family: "DejaVu Sans", Arial, sans-serif; font-size: 11pt; color: #222; line-height: 1.4; }
        h1 { font-size: 18pt; margin: 0 0 6pt 0; color: #0d2148; text-align: center; }

        .banner { text-align: center; margin: 0 0 12pt 0; }
        .banner img { display: inline-block; max-width: 60%; max-height: 90pt; }

        .header-right {
            text-align: right;
            margin-bottom: 24pt;
            font-size: 10pt;
        }
        .header-right .who { font-weight: 700; font-size: 12pt; color: #0d2148; }

        .meta { margin-top: 18pt; padding: 8pt 12pt; background: #f4f6fa; border-left: 3pt solid #0d2148; font-size: 10pt; }
        .meta strong { color: #0d2148; }

        table.items { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 24pt 0 10pt 0; font-size: 11pt; }
        table.items th { background: #0d2148; color: #fff; padding: 8pt 10pt; text-align: left; font-weight: 700; }
        table.items td { padding: 10pt; border-bottom: 1pt solid #dfe3ec; }
        table.items td.amount { text-align: right; white-space: nowrap; }

        .total { text-align: right; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: 700; color: #0d2148; margin-top: 8pt; }

        /* Tampon « FACTURE ACQUITTÉE » — imitation cachet rouge posé
           en oblique par-dessus la facture, semi-transparent pour ne
           pas cacher les lignes. */
        .stamp {
            position: absolute;
            top: 55%;
            left: 50%;
            transform: translate(-50%, -50%) rotate(-18deg);
            border: 4pt double #c62828;
            color: #c62828;
            padding: 8pt 22pt;
            font-size: 24pt;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2pt;
            opacity: 0.55;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            font-family: "DejaVu Sans", Arial, sans-serif;
        }
        .payment { margin-top: 20pt; padding: 8pt 12pt; background: #ecfdf5; border-left: 3pt solid #16a34a; font-size: 10pt; }

        .signature { margin-top: 24pt; width: 100%; }
        .signature td { vertical-align: middle; font-size: 10pt; padding: 0; }
        .signature .sig-left { width: 50%; text-align: left; }
        .signature .sig-right { width: 50%; text-align: right; }
        .signature .sig-label { margin-bottom: 2pt; font-style: italic; color: #4b5563; }
        .signature .sig-name { font-weight: 700; }
        .signature .sig-img img { max-width: 140pt; max-height: 60pt; display: inline-block; }

        .footer {
            position: fixed;
            bottom: -20mm;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            text-align: center;
            color: #4b5563;
            font-size: 9pt;
            padding-top: 6pt;
            border-top: 1pt solid #dfe3ec;
        }
        .footer .club-name { font-weight: 700; color: #0d2148; }
        .footer .legal { white-space: pre-line; margin-top: 3pt; color: #6b7280; font-size: 8.5pt; }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

{% if bannerDataUri %}
    <div class="banner">
        <img src="{{ bannerDataUri }}" alt="{{ settings.clubName }}">
    </div>
{% endif %}

<div class="header-right">
    <div class="who">{{ user.fullName }}</div>
    {% if user.adresse %}{{ user.adresse|nl2br }}{% endif %}
</div>

<h1>{{ isAttestation ? 'Attestation de paiement' : 'Facture' }}</h1>

{% if isAttestation %}
    <div class="meta">
        <strong>N° document :</strong> {{ invoiceNumber }}<br>
        <strong>Émise le :</strong> {{ issuedAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:14pt; font-size:10.5pt;">
        Nous attestons que la cotisation ci-dessous a été réglée directement auprès de la
        Fédération Française de Triathlon (FFTri) via l'Espace Tri, pour l'adhésion au club
        Triathlon Toulouse Métropole.
    </p>
{% else %}
    <div class="meta">
        <strong>N° facture :</strong> {{ invoiceNumber }}<br>
        <strong>Émise le :</strong> {{ issuedAt|date('d/m/Y à H:i') }}
    </div>
{% endif %}

<table class="items">
    <thead>
        <tr>
            <th>Prestation</th>
            <th style="text-align:right;">Montant TTC</th>
        </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
        <tr>
            <td>Adhésion {{ typeLicence }} — Saison {{ seasonLabel }}</td>
            <td class="amount">{{ (fee.amountCents / 100)|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €</td>
        </tr>
    </tbody>
</table>

<div class="total">
    Total : {{ (fee.amountCents / 100)|number_format(2, ',', ' ') }} €
</div>

<div class="stamp">{{ isAttestation ? 'Paiement confirmé' : 'Facture acquittée' }}</div>

<div class="payment">
    <strong>Mode de paiement :</strong> {{ paymentTypeLabel }}
</div>

<table class="signature">
    <tr>
        <td class="sig-left">
            <div class="sig-label">Le Président,</div>
            <div class="sig-name">{{ settings.presidentName }}</div>
        </td>
        <td class="sig-right">
            {% if signatureDataUri %}
                <div class="sig-img"><img src="{{ signatureDataUri }}" alt="Signature"></div>
            {% endif %}
        </td>
    </tr>
</table>

<div class="footer">
    <div class="club-name">Triathlon Toulouse Métropole</div>
    <div>54, rue des 7 Troubadours &mdash; 31000 Toulouse</div>
    {% if settings.legalFooter %}
        <div class="legal">{{ settings.legalFooter }}</div>
    {% endif %}
</div>

</body>
</html>
